
# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/

# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
*.db
.beads-credential-key
.beads/proxieddb/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Test fixtures cloned by scripts/prepare-test-case.sh
#
# ⚠️  NEVER ADD THE CONTENTS OF tests/fixtures/ TO GIT.
#
#   - These directories hold full clones of third-party repositories
#     (e.g., udhaya10/tldr-code) used as real-world test inputs.
#   - They are rebuildable at any time with `./scripts/prepare-test-case.sh`.
#   - Committing them would bloat history, mix in upstream licenses, and
#     create merge nightmares.
#   - If you find yourself wanting to commit one, STOP and ask why your test
#     can't rebuild the fixture from the script instead.
#
# Everything inside tests/fixtures/ is gitignored EXCEPT a README.md that
# documents the rule for future contributors.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
tests/fixtures/*
!tests/fixtures/README.md
